{"id":"8e6a863785f69243","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-view.md","title":"Verifier View","display":"df-view — Verifier View","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-df-view","aliases":["28-df-view","Verifier View"],"display":"df-view — Verifier View","depends_on":["[[28-df-interactive-transcript]]","[[28-df-ppt]]"],"source_book_location":"Definition 9.14 output simulation context; printed p.187; PDF p.213","source_printed_pages":"187","source_pdf_pages":"213","source_status":"supplementary-formalization"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-view"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-view</span><span>Verifier View</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-view — Verifier View"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3e270c20bc5033b3\" href=\"?note=3e270c20bc5033b3\" title=\"28-df-interactive-transcript\">28-df-interactive-transcript</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b75200f005282ddf\" href=\"?note=b75200f005282ddf\" title=\"28-df-ppt\">28-df-ppt</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_book_location","html":"Definition 9.14 output simulation context; printed p.187; PDF p.213"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"187"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"213"},{"key":"source_status","html":"supplementary-formalization"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V=(k,b,p,Q,D)\\in\\mathsf{IV}\">\\(V=(k,b,p,Q,D)\\in\\mathsf{IV}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{IV},\\mathsf{Strat}_b,\\operatorname{Trans},\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{seq}}\">\\(\\mathsf{IV},\\mathsf{Strat}_b,\\operatorname{Trans},\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{seq}}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"3e270c20bc5033b3\" href=\"?note=3e270c20bc5033b3\" title=\"28-df-interactive-transcript\">28-df-interactive-transcript</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P=(s,H)\">\\(P=(s,H)\\)</span> 是带随机带长度的证明者表示，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\in\\mathbb N[n]\">\\(s\\in\\mathbb N[n]\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H:\\Sigma^*\\times\\Sigma^*\\times\\Sigma^*\\times(\\Sigma^*)^{&lt;\\omega}\\to\\Sigma^*\">\\(H:\\Sigma^*\\times\\Sigma^*\\times\\Sigma^*\\times(\\Sigma^*)^{&lt;\\omega}\\to\\Sigma^*\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H(x,u;r,h)\">\\(H(x,u;r,h)\\)</span> 表示在公共输入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span>、私有输入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\">\\(u\\)</span>、随机带 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\">\\(r\\)</span>、消息历史 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h\">\\(h\\)</span> 下的下一条消息。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,u\\in\\Sigma^*\">\\(x,u\\in\\Sigma^*\\)</span> 固定，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall r\\in\\Sigma^*\\;\\forall h\\in(\\Sigma^*)^{&lt;\\omega}\\;|H(x,u;r,h)|\\le b(|x|)\">\\(\\forall r\\in\\Sigma^*\\;\\forall h\\in(\\Sigma^*)^{&lt;\\omega}\\;|H(x,u;r,h)|\\le b(|x|)\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ell=2k(|x|)\">\\(\\ell=2k(|x|)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r_V\\leftarrow U_{p(|x|)}\">\\(r_V\\leftarrow U_{p(|x|)}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r_P\\leftarrow U_{s(|x|+|u|)}\">\\(r_P\\leftarrow U_{s(|x|+|u|)}\\)</span> 相互独立。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U_j\">\\(U_j\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma^j\">\\(\\Sigma^j\\)</span> 上均匀分布；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L\">\\(\\mathcal L\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b75200f005282ddf\" href=\"?note=b75200f005282ddf\" title=\"28-df-ppt\">28-df-ppt</a>。已结束的策略输出固定空串 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varepsilon\">\\(\\varepsilon\\)</span>，以适配固定轮数表示。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H_{x,u}\">\\(H_{x,u}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{View}_V^P(x,u)\">\\(\\operatorname{View}_V^P(x,u)\\)</span> 由下式定义；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y,r\\in\\Sigma^*\">\\(y,r\\in\\Sigma^*\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h\\in(\\Sigma^*)^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(h\\in(\\Sigma^*)^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span>。在记录式中，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m_1,\\ldots,m_\\ell,a_{\\mathsf{out}}\">\\(m_1,\\ldots,m_\\ell,a_{\\mathsf{out}}\\)</span> 是指定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Trans}\">\\(\\operatorname{Trans}\\)</span> 的对应分量；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle a_{\\mathsf{out}}\\rangle\\in\\Sigma^1\">\\(\\langle a_{\\mathsf{out}}\\rangle\\in\\Sigma^1\\)</span> 是该输出比特构成的单字符字串。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"H_{x,u}(y,r,h)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}H(x,u;r,h)&amp;y=x,\\\\\\varepsilon&amp;y\\ne x,\\end{cases}\\qquad H_{x,u}\\in\\mathsf{Strat}_b.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[H_{x,u}(y,r,h)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}H(x,u;r,h)&amp;y=x,\\\\\\varepsilon&amp;y\\ne x,\\end{cases}\\qquad H_{x,u}\\in\\mathsf{Strat}_b.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\langle x,m_1,\\ldots,m_\\ell,a_{\\mathsf{out}}\\rangle\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Trans}_{H_{x,u},V}(x;r_P,r_V).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\langle x,m_1,\\ldots,m_\\ell,a_{\\mathsf{out}}\\rangle\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Trans}_{H_{x,u},V}(x;r_P,r_V).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{View}_V^P(x,u)\\coloneqq\\mathcal L_{r_P,r_V}\\left(\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{seq}}\\!\\left(\\left\\langle x,r_V,\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{seq}}\\!\\left((m_i)_{1\\le i\\le\\ell,\\;i\\equiv1\\pmod2}\\right),\\langle a_{\\mathsf{out}}\\rangle\\right\\rangle\\right)\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{View}_V^P(x,u)\\coloneqq\\mathcal L_{r_P,r_V}\\left(\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{seq}}\\!\\left(\\left\\langle x,r_V,\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{seq}}\\!\\left((m_i)_{1\\le i\\le\\ell,\\;i\\equiv1\\pmod2}\\right),\\langle a_{\\mathsf{out}}\\rangle\\right\\rangle\\right)\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{View}_V^P(x)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{View}_V^P(x,\\varepsilon)\\qquad\\left(\\forall r\\in\\Sigma^*\\;\\forall h\\in(\\Sigma^*)^{&lt;\\omega}\\;|H(x,\\varepsilon;r,h)|\\le b(|x|)\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{View}_V^P(x)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{View}_V^P(x,\\varepsilon)\\qquad\\left(\\forall r\\in\\Sigma^*\\;\\forall h\\in(\\Sigma^*)^{&lt;\\omega}\\;|H(x,\\varepsilon;r,h)|\\le b(|x|)\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>视图包含公共输入、验证者随机性、实际收到的全部证明者消息和输出。验证者已发消息由这些数据递归决定。原稿的上界 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2\\lfloor\\ell/2\\rfloor+1\">\\(2\\lfloor\\ell/2\\rfloor+1\\)</span> 在偶数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ell\">\\(\\ell\\)</span> 时越过真实记录末尾；这里按填充后记录中的合法轮索引抽取，空消息的值固定为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varepsilon\">\\(\\varepsilon\\)</span>。本书定义 9.14 使用验证者最终输出，视图是可由作弊验证者记录并输出的加强接口。</p>\n<p>R7：最终输出位改记为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a_{\\mathsf{out}}\">\\(a_{\\mathsf{out}}\\)</span>，避免与验证者结构中的消息长度多项式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b\">\\(b\\)</span> 共用同一符号；视图的数据及分布保持原义。</p>\n<p>本次接口修订：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\">\\(s\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span> 的确定分量，不是可以任意放大的未绑定上界。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H_{x,u}\">\\(H_{x,u}\\)</span> 在其他公共输入上返回空串，因此当前输入上的消息长度假设已经足以满足上游 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Strat}_b\">\\(\\mathsf{Strat}_b\\)</span> 的全输入要求。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-interactive-transcript","status":"resolved","id":"3e270c20bc5033b3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-interactive-transcript]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-ppt","status":"resolved","id":"b75200f005282ddf","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-ppt]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-interactive-transcript","status":"resolved","id":"3e270c20bc5033b3","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}$；$V=(k,b,p,Q,D)\\in\\mathsf{IV}$，$\\mathsf{IV},\\mathsf{Strat}_b,\\operatorname{Trans},\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{seq}}$ 见 [[28-df-interactive-transcript]]。","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-ppt","status":"resolved","id":"b75200f005282ddf","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\ell=2k(|x|)$；$r_V\\leftarrow U_{p(|x|)}$、$r_P\\leftarrow U_{s(|x|+|u|)}$ 相互独立。$U_j$ 为 $\\Sigma^j$ 上均匀分布；$\\mathcal L$ 见 [[28-df-ppt]]。已结束的策略输出固定空串 $\\varepsilon$，以适配固定轮数表示。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"V=(k,b,p,Q,D)\\in\\mathsf{IV}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{IV},\\mathsf{Strat}_b,\\operatorname{Trans},\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{seq}}","display":false},{"tex":"P=(s,H)","display":false},{"tex":"s\\in\\mathbb N[n]","display":false},{"tex":"H:\\Sigma^*\\times\\Sigma^*\\times\\Sigma^*\\times(\\Sigma^*)^{<\\omega}\\to\\Sigma^*","display":false},{"tex":"H(x,u;r,h)","display":false},{"tex":"x","display":false},{"tex":"u","display":false},{"tex":"r","display":false},{"tex":"h","display":false},{"tex":"x,u\\in\\Sigma^*","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall r\\in\\Sigma^*\\;\\forall h\\in(\\Sigma^*)^{<\\omega}\\;|H(x,u;r,h)|\\le b(|x|)","display":false},{"tex":"\\ell=2k(|x|)","display":false},{"tex":"r_V\\leftarrow U_{p(|x|)}","display":false},{"tex":"r_P\\leftarrow U_{s(|x|+|u|)}","display":false},{"tex":"U_j","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma^j","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L","display":false},{"tex":"\\varepsilon","display":false},{"tex":"H_{x,u}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{View}_V^P(x,u)","display":false},{"tex":"y,r\\in\\Sigma^*","display":false},{"tex":"h\\in(\\Sigma^*)^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"m_1,\\ldots,m_\\ell,a_{\\mathsf{out}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Trans}","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle a_{\\mathsf{out}}\\rangle\\in\\Sigma^1","display":false},{"tex":"H_{x,u}(y,r,h)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}H(x,u;r,h)&y=x,\\\\\\varepsilon&y\\ne x,\\end{cases}\\qquad H_{x,u}\\in\\mathsf{Strat}_b.","display":true},{"tex":"\\langle x,m_1,\\ldots,m_\\ell,a_{\\mathsf{out}}\\rangle\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Trans}_{H_{x,u},V}(x;r_P,r_V).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{View}_V^P(x,u)\\coloneqq\\mathcal L_{r_P,r_V}\\left(\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{seq}}\\!\\left(\\left\\langle x,r_V,\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{seq}}\\!\\left((m_i)_{1\\le i\\le\\ell,\\;i\\equiv1\\pmod2}\\right),\\langle a_{\\mathsf{out}}\\rangle\\right\\rangle\\right)\\right).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{View}_V^P(x)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{View}_V^P(x,\\varepsilon)\\qquad\\left(\\forall r\\in\\Sigma^*\\;\\forall h\\in(\\Sigma^*)^{<\\omega}\\;|H(x,\\varepsilon;r,h)|\\le b(|x|)\\right).","display":true},{"tex":"2\\lfloor\\ell/2\\rfloor+1","display":false},{"tex":"\\ell","display":false},{"tex":"\\varepsilon","display":false},{"tex":"a_{\\mathsf{out}}","display":false},{"tex":"b","display":false},{"tex":"s","display":false},{"tex":"P","display":false},{"tex":"H_{x,u}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Strat}_b","display":false}],"bytes":3206,"backlinks":[{"id":"278046f9a093bf22","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$P=(s,H)$ 采用 [[28-df-view]] 的带固定随机长度的证明者表示；$L,R,(P,V)$、$\\Sigma$、证书界及完备性、健全性采用 [[28-df-zero-knowledge]] 的前提；这里固定协议规定的诚实验证者 $V$。"},{"id":"74e0b51f1b8e81e1","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$P=(s,H)$ 采用 [[28-df-view]] 的证明者表示；$s\\in\\mathbb N[n]$，$H$ 为该定义中的总消息函数。$(P,V)$ 是 $L$ 的交互证明：$P$ 在 $(x,u)$、$V$ 在 $x$ 上交互；对每个 $R(x,u)$ 完备性至少 $2/3$，对每个 $x\\notin L$、任意无界证明者策略 $P^*$，健全性错误至多 $1/3$。$P,V$ 在任意收到的消息流上自身执行的时间、随机位及消息长度均以 $|x|$ 多项式有界，超长消息可由计时器截断。"},{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-146","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"分布与视图：[[28-df-ensemble]]、[[28-df-view]]、[[28-df-statistical-distance]]、[[28-df-computational-indistinguishability]]。"}],"outgoing":["3e270c20bc5033b3","b75200f005282ddf"]}